{"obsah":"<p><strong>7/5 – Exhibition and workshop in Jílové near Děčín – Motorbike blessing</strong></p>\n\n<p>Martin Šimůnek and Lukáš Valný set off to Jílové near Děčín for the annual motorbike blessing. Their job wasn't just to jump for crowds of kids and adult spectators, but also to run our workshop, where everyone could test how good they are at riding over obstacles and their technique. Martin once again showed his quality as a host – and that he matures like wine with age. The organisers' thanks are always nice, and thank you for the invitation.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F278396724_1435607403564549_6495842830587317245_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F278396724_1435607403564549_6495842830587317245_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208805\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F279834313_952544558765700_2635860780420987464_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F279834313_952544558765700_2635860780420987464_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208806\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F279913742_678768673233947_6542353630949572664_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F279913742_678768673233947_