/a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F280141741_1189526031837683_5958210111768573121_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F280141741_1189526031837683_5958210111768573121_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208812\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F280270007_358558792787867_4251136282457359614_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F280270007_358558792787867_4251136282457359614_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208811\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F280383076_328829972708771_4842063107756862570_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F280383076_328829972708771_4842063107756862570_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208809\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<p><strong>7/5 – Exhibition in Horní Maršov, Krkonoše</strong></p>\n\n<p>Horní Maršov was dominated by two experienced riders: Petr Jeřicha, who focuses mainly on Enduro due to a back injury, but whose Trial title still shows. Together with Michal Budský, who rides a street bike, they alone would probably have been enough for the organisers – but why not show the young ones how riders their own age ride? Matouš Balík is a new member of our team and a young gun in the club at junior level. Despite being in the middle of his school-leaving exams, he went with Petr and Michal to gain experience and ride with legends of the Trial sport. Here too we received positive feedback from the organisers, and we thank them for the invitation and the great atmosphere.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-05-09-v-9.03.56.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-05-09-v-9.03.56.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208813\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-05-09-v-9.04.17.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-05-09-v-9.04.17.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208816\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-05-09-v-9.08.19.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-05-09-v-9.08.19.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208815\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-05-09-v-9.08.13.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeski